  "description": "Eunwon, who has a one-sided crush on their older brother, Woosuk, has been living with him for a year. Actually, Woosuk is not their biological brother, but their older step-brother...however, to be close to him, Eunwon even cross-dressed and became his roommate. They anticipated a heart-fluttering campus life, but everything changed after a night with a drunk Woosuk at a club gathering. Woosuk acts like nothing happened, having no memory of the event, leaving Eunwon confused. Finally, Eunwon decides to sleep with the drunk Woosuk again...\n\n*“Brother...no, oppa, do you want to sleep with me?”*\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
